    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">Molly is facing a new future. She hasn&apos;t worked for seven years - well, not technically, although looking after a demanding family has been trial enough. And given her recent multi-tasking at home as nurse, chef and peace negotiator, surely she&apos;d be a catch for any employer?...Her ex-boss is persuaded to give her work filming a documentary starring a cantankerous eighty-three-year-old actress called Florence Bird. As filming progresses Molly realises how complicated life can be. But despite their differences Molly and Florence forge a remarkable friendship - one that helps them both confront their fears and answer the all-important question, how long have you got?</marc:subfield>
